      "sentence": "The comment explicitly mentions specific parts of the paper: \"No real-world results\" and \"No discussion of systems aspects: training step and inference speed, memory in contrast to other approaches.\" These are clear, identifiable sections or aspects, so the authors can confidently pinpoint where the comment addresses.",
