      "explanation": "The evaluated comment does not reference any specific section, figure, table, or other locatable part of the paper, so this claim is factually incorrect."
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Thus, it is both fully grounded and specific, meeting the criteria for a score of 5.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "The criteria for score 5 requires the comment to explicitly identify which part of the paper it addresses, which this comment does not do, so the rubric is misapplied here."
    }
  ],
